# issue: none
# notes: One checked warmup precedes one measured query per fresh process; a restart and exact result check follow. This repetition boundary differs from the former repeated Rust timing loop.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 60000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- query
query count_bare() { match { $p: Person } return { count($p) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n":20}
--- expect shape
n: I64

--- query
query count_bare() { match { $p: Person } return { count($p) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n":20}
--- expect shape
n: I64

--- restart

--- query
query count_bare() { match { $p: Person } return { count($p) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n":20}
--- expect shape
n: I64
